  "body": "7A Otakau Road, Milford\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n3 spacious bedrooms\r\n2.5 bathrooms\r\nComfortable open living & dining\r\nVersatile additional multi-purpose space\r\nSought-after Milford location\r\nClose to Milford Beach & Village\r\nSpace, Flexibility & a Coastal Lifestyle\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned for families and professionals, this inviting three-bedroom home combines generous living, a flexible layout and the lifestyle advantages that make Milford such a sought-after place to call home.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover comfortable living and dining spaces designed for everyday life. Whether it's relaxed evenings at home, family time or entertaining friends, there's room to settle in, unwind and make the space your own.\r\n\r\nThree well-proportioned bedrooms provide comfortable retreats, with a spacious master bedroom complemented by 2.5 bathrooms for added everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nAdding another dimension to the property is the converted double garage, providing valuable additional multi-purpose space. Whether you're looking for a home office, gym, hobby area, media room or simply extra space to spread out, it offers flexibility to adapt as your needs change.\r\n\r\nOutside, enjoy the relaxed atmosphere that comes with living in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nWith Milford Beach, Milford Village, shopping, cafés, restaurants, schools and everyday amenities all within easy reach, this is a location that brings lifestyle and convenience together beautifully.\r\n\r\nIf space, flexibility and the Milford lifestyle are high on your wish list, 7A Otakau Road deserves your attention. Come and experience it for yourself - contact Hattie Liu today to arrange your viewing",
